OL,3,ATwo mass shootings in South Africa
OL,4,Aleave 17 dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth African police are investigating
OL,7,Fthe murders of 17 people in two
OL,8,Fseparate shootings on Sunday night.
OL,10,FEight men were fatally shot in a
OL,11,Fminibus in KwaZulu-Natal province.
OL,12,FPolice declared them dead when they
OL,13,Farrived at the scene. Hours later, nine
OL,14,Fpeople were found shot dead inside a
OL,15,Fshack in western Pretoria.
OL,17,FPolice say the two incidents are
OL,18,Funrelated. The motive for the shootings
OL,19,Fhas not yet been established.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
