OL,3,ATwo mass shootings in South Africa
OL,4,Aleave 17 dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africa is struggling to contain
OL,7,Fviolent crime, including gang-related
OL,8,Fkillings. The country has one of the
OL,9,Fworld's highest murder rates.
